 rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>一級省電冷暖分離式冷氣&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>晶片進出安全無虞&nbsp;&nbsp;房間門高級指紋門鎖(免帶鑰匙)</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>專人收垃圾&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 255);\"><strong>打掃垃圾專人清運&nbsp;<br></strong></span><strong><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 255);\"><strong>套房位於板橋精華地段&nbsp;府中捷運站走路5分鐘</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(204, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊飲食超方便：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>巷口立即有便利商店、家樂福、全聯.&nbsp;燒烤、&nbsp;自助餐、蚵仔煎、肉圓、牛排館、鹹酥雞、魯味、水餃館、蚵仔麵線、豆花店.火鍋店．．．等等。（根本就是出外人的方便）&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊交通超方便：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>出門即是多線公車站牌，走路八分鐘可到府中捷運站.騎車三分鐘即可到達板橋車站（四鐵共構）、臨近南雅夜市&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊娛樂超方便：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>步行五分鐘即可到板橋體育場，騎車三分鐘即可到達板橋後站、遠東百貨、縣政府廣場，騎車五分鐘到達南雅夜市、板橋錢櫃KTV、好樂迪KTV。&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊出入超安全：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>大門進出入設有感應器、走道設有攝影機、房門設有安全防盜鏈、樓層中設有滅火器設備。&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊設備超齊全：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>附雙人床組&nbsp;冷氣&nbsp;液晶電視&nbsp;冰箱&nbsp;洗衣機&nbsp;書桌&nbsp;衣櫃&nbsp;全新衛浴設備&nbsp;12加侖電熱水器&nbsp;大門口晶片密碼鎖&nbsp;專人清理垃圾&nbsp;。&nbsp;<br>(保證讓你看了會喜歡的舒適環境)&nbsp;<br></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>租金10800元</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>歡迎來電預約看屋0932001135&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近府中捷運公車站、林家花園公車站、府中捷運站、板橋火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區文昌街24巷", "lat": "25.0107288", "lng": "121.4559860", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "府中捷運站", "distance": 421, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約421公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "北門街站", "distance": 89, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約89公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "北門街(黃石市場)站", "distance": 96, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約96公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "複合式商場", "distance": 452, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約452公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "可汗大叔【 臭臭布丁】麻辣鴨血｜肥腸｜臭豆腐 板橋店", "distance": 18, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約18公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市板橋區板橋國小後門", "distance": 201, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約201公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立大觀國民中學", "distance": 734, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約734公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "10,800元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、第四台、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "6坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "中檔裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "其他特色", "value": "近捷運、新上架、可報稅、拎包入住、隨時可遷入", "key": "tags", "alias": "", "cate": 2}]}, "linkInfo": {"avatar": "https://images.591.com.tw/index/medium/no-photo-new.png", "chargeTxt": "", "name": "卓先生", "role": 2, "roleName": "代理人", "rol